# Logging

- Log with `loglayer`. Type the logger as `ILogLayer`.
- In tests, use `MockLogLayer`. Do not assert on log messages; `MockLogLayer` does not emit them.
- Log `Error` instances with `logger.withError(error)`.
- Log structured data with `logger.withMetadata({ ... })`.
